@startuml
Participant "LFI 1 Corda Network \nApplication\n<<Workflow SDK>>" as CORDA_NETWORK_APP 
Participant "Signing \nService LFI 1" as SIGNING_SERVICE 
' Participant "HSM" as HSM 



Participant "LFI 2 Corda Network \nApplication\n<<Workflow SDK>>" as CORDA_NETWORK_APP2 
Participant "Signing \nService LFI 2" as SIGNING_SERVICE2
autonumber 1.0


-> CORDA_NETWORK_APP: Start Workflow
CORDA_NETWORK_APP -> CORDA_NETWORK_APP: Prepare message

CORDA_NETWORK_APP -> CORDA_NETWORK_APP: Create random symmetric secret: SYM_K

CORDA_NETWORK_APP -> CORDA_NETWORK_APP: Create HMAC message with \nSYM_K (and append to msg)

alt First message to Counterpart

CORDA_NETWORK_APP -> SIGNING_SERVICE: Sign SYM_K
SIGNING_SERVICE --> CORDA_NETWORK_APP: Signed SYM_K
CORDA_NETWORK_APP -> CORDA_NETWORK_APP: Encrypt SYM_K message with \nCounterpart public key\n and save in memory WRAP(SYM_K)


' else Successive messages to Counterpart ...

end

== 2:  For every message ==

CORDA_NETWORK_APP -> CORDA_NETWORK_APP: Append WRAP(SYM_K) to message

CORDA_NETWORK_APP -> CORDA_NETWORK_APP2: Send message

autonumber 2.0
alt First message with this WRAPPED KEY
CORDA_NETWORK_APP2 -> SIGNING_SERVICE2: Extract SYM_K from WRAP(SYM_K)\n 
CORDA_NETWORK_APP2 -> CORDA_NETWORK_APP2: Verify SYM_K signature with \nCounterpart public key (Cert) and save in memory
end

CORDA_NETWORK_APP2 -> CORDA_NETWORK_APP2: Verify HMAC message with \nSYM_K: MSG OK
CORDA_NETWORK_APP2 -> CORDA_NETWORK_APP2: process message

@enduml